{"ID":"20240118145014-80jmwas","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145014-80jmwas","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145014-80jmwas\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145014-5oaijco\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161738-av0tc72\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161738-av0tc72\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:61,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:61\u0026#125;","title":"319莽草","type":"doc","updated":"20240204144544"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145014-5oaijco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145014-5oaijco","updated":"20240122161721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，有毒。治风头，痈肿，乳痈，疝瘕，除结气，疥瘙，杀虫、鱼。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161725-o6cckth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161725-o6cckth"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161728-0yyk2ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161728-0yyk2ne"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛性温有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161726-5jevi6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161726-5jevi6r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】消肿，杀虫要药，治痈肿，瘰疬，疥癣，白秃，头风痛及皮肤麻痹。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161730-d5jopaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161730-d5jopaw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗喉痹不通，乳难，头风痒，可用沐，勿内服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161731-v4ivfnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161731-v4ivfnq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治风疽疝气肿坠，凝血，治瘰疬，除风湿，不入汤服，主头疮白秃，杀虫，与白蔹，赤小豆为末，鸡子白调之如糊，敷毒肿，干更易之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161734-lpusqla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161734-lpusqla"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161736-7zp9i7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161736-7zp9i7t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】只可做沐汤及外敷药，不可内服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161737-fec11og","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161737-fec11og"}},{"ID":"20240122161737-5e3422q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161737-5e3422q"}},{"ID":"20240122161738-hbuoevr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161738-hbuoevr"}},{"ID":"20240122161738-av0tc72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161738-av0tc72","updated":"20240204144544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"319莽草，这个莽草呢，一般来说，我们都不内服，只做外敷，煮汤啊洗身体，这个外用的。一般药房里面买不到莽草，诸位看看就可以了。那以我的看法，因为这个药，现在这个人会用得不多，我们到阳明山上看很多芒草，那个芒是这个“芒”，芒草哦，很像芦苇，尾巴这样长起来。我个人的想法就那个东西，山上到处都有。因为现在人很少使用它了，所以药房也抓不到。那反正是外用的，诸位可以买来，自己采回来使用没关系，这个，对身体、皮肤一定会很好的。诸位记得，你看那个花类的东西，像那个，它种子在传播的时候，会有枊(ang)，长枊，风一吹的时候到处飘，你看它性那么轻，那么轻的浮在表面上，浮在空中，可以散到很远的地方，它可以到皮肤表面上。所以说外洗一定可以使用，绝对不会有问题的，是杀虫的药，身上的疥廯呐、皮肤痒呐什么都可以使用。"}]}]}